			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I agree it’s ugly, but honestly, html is generally pretty ugly. I’m going to get my job done more easily and sleep better at night so that’s a win in my book. And yes, I do know CSS. YMMV.</p>",
