			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hachyderm.io/@olets\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>olets</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> some valid points of criticism imo <a href=\"https://nuejs.org/blog/tailwind-misinformation-engine/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">nuejs.org/blog/tailwind-misinf</span><span class=\"invisible\">ormation-engine/</span></a></p><p>Via <a href=\"https://phpc.social/@davidbisset/112101086394573055\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">phpc.social/@davidbisset/11210</span><span class=\"invisible\">1086394573055</span></a></p>",
